Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.30,0:00:06.58,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1218)\fad(200,250)\fnPoppins\b1\fs96\c&HFFFFFF&\bord0\shad0}o que ele pode fazer no seu rim?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Seu pai deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}sua mãe deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}seu avô deve ter,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:03.36,0:00:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o seu vizinho deve ter
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Nesse mês de novembro,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.22,0:00:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente tem uma data
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.98,0:00:09.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}muito importante,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que é o Dia Mundial
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.16,0:00:11.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do Diabetes
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Mas o diabetes
Dialogue: 2,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}vai muito além
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}desse açúcar no sangue
Dialogue: 2,0:00:16.22,0:00:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O que esse diabetes
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}pode fazer no seu rim?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Vocês já viram falar
Dialogue: 2,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}do fundo do olho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.30,0:00:28.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para o diabético?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:28.10,0:00:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}O fundo do olho
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é um exame
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.24,0:00:31.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}extremamente importante
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}em pacientes diabéticos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Os vasos que têm
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dentro do olho,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}aqueles microvasos,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:41.92,0:00:43.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}eles são parecidos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.04,0:00:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}com os microvasos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que têm dentro do rim
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.58,0:00:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando a gente consegue
Dialogue: 2,0:00:46.72,0:00:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ver lesão nesses microvasos
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.12,0:00:49.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}no olho,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.04,0:00:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a gente já sabe
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que tem lesão no rim
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}As primeiras lesões de rim
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.98,0:00:56.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}acontecem com a
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}perda de proteína
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}É aquela história
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que perde o pó
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Quando você perde esse pó,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.94,0:01:06.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você mostra que o teu rim,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:06.58,0:01:07.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o teu filtro,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.58,0:01:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}não está íntegro,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ele tem furos a mais
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}que estão passando
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}o que não deveria passar
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.16,0:01:13.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Às vezes,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:13.86,0:01:16.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}a função continua normal,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}mas você já tem o início
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.66,0:01:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}dessa doença renal
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.12,0:01:22.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Lembrando que a doença renal
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.34,0:01:24.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}só começa a ter sintomas
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.60,0:01:29.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}A maioria das vezes
Dialogue: 2,0:01:29.50,0:01:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você não percebe,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.86,0:01:31.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}você só vai perceber
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.86,0:01:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}no exame de sangue
Dialogue: 2,0:01:33.46,0:01:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hoje em dia,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.20,0:01:35.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}nós temos inúmeras
Dialogue: 2,0:01:35.10,0:01:36.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}medicações novas,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}então nós temos
Dialogue: 2,0:01:37.46,0:01:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}muitas coisas
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.40,0:01:39.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para fazer por você
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Então, a minha dica aqui
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.80,0:01:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}é de que você peça
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.36,0:01:44.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para o teu médico
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.14,0:01:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}fazer um exame de urina
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}e um exame de creatinina
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.34,0:01:47.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}para você
